    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1500100/extras/6d68bdb362d1dec74469ce602f557219.avif?t=1724952965\" /></div><br><br>*All characters in this game are18 years of age or older.<br><br>This game is a fantasy RPG featuring a modern-day NEET (uneducated, unemployed young man) summoned into a parallel universe by a magical girl to become her sadistic Familiar and create havoc!<br><br>The protagonist of the story goes on a journey with his master, the magical girl, to stop Demon King's resurrection.<br><br>Within his journey, the protagonist comes to the truth behind his summoning.<br><br><br>Game Features:<br>\u30fbA turn-based magical fantasy RPG<br><br>\u30fbEasy battle system<br>Battle against weak enemies is done in an instant with a single attack<br><br>\u30fbThe Demon King's Henchwomen<br>They are strong enemies, but once you defeat them, you can summon them in battles at any time and deploy their special attacks.<br><br>\u30fbMultiple endings<br>How this story ends will depend on what choices you make.<br><br><br>\u30fbClearing the game unlocks the Debug Mode!<br>Using the Debug Mode will break the game.",
